description	"Darth Traya

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber
-- ^6Desann ^7/ ^5Tavion ^7Styles
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump	(2)
- Push	(3)
- Pull	(3)
- Sense (2)
- Mind Trick (2)
- Speed	(1)
- Team Heal  (1)
- Grip	(3)
- Team Energize (2)
- Repulse ^5[CS1 Melee]

^8Attributes:
- Invisible to Sense
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (1)
- Healing (2)

Darth Traya was a female Human Jedi Master-turned-Sith Master during the Dark Wars and Dark Lord of the Sith Triumvirate, ruling over the remnants of the Sith forces after their defeat in the Jedi Civil War. Prior to the Mandalorian Wars, Kreia was a Jedi Master and Jedi historian, who was exiled by the Jedi High Council because her students followed the Jedi Knight Revan, her former Padawan, into battle against the invading Mandalorians." 